WEBVTT

00:40.140 --> 00:42.040
He got in another fight.

00:42.100 --> 00:43.500
Seriously?

00:43.600 --> 00:45.200
He's nothing but trouble.

00:46.900 --> 00:51.100
Again? That's why I was against all this.

00:51.100 --> 00:52.780
Better stay away.

00:52.780 --> 00:54.680
Don't even let him see you.

00:54.680 --> 00:58.300
What do you expect? He doesn't know
how to interact with people.

00:58.300 --> 01:01.000
With looks like that, how could he?

01:01.100 --> 01:04.860
I told you to dye your hair black!
How many times will it take?!

01:04.860 --> 01:06.500
Your wallet's gone?

01:06.500 --> 01:08.660
- Bet he stole it.
- He's the worst.

01:08.660 --> 01:10.920
And seriously, what's with that hair?

01:10.920 --> 01:12.780
What's with that eye?

01:12.780 --> 01:14.820
Dude's a walking curse.

01:15.160 --> 01:17.060
Disgusting.

01:38.300 --> 01:39.040
Tch.

01:41.960 --> 01:45.000
[East Wind Shopping Street]

01:45.500 --> 01:48.040
Wait for me!

01:59.800 --> 02:02.040
I like the strong.

02:02.480 --> 02:04.900
I don't care about the weak.

02:07.720 --> 02:09.940
Get out of my way, I said!

02:10.060 --> 02:12.420
Hey, don't be like that.

02:12.580 --> 02:16.480
Don't you wanna go somewhere? Do something?

02:17.260 --> 02:19.360
I want…

02:20.440 --> 02:22.740
to smash these eggs on your faces.

02:23.060 --> 02:25.920
But my hands are full and it'd be a waste of eggs.

02:26.260 --> 02:27.680
So I won't.

02:29.820 --> 02:32.340
I like feisty girls,

02:32.520 --> 02:35.880
but get too uppity
and it'll come back to bite you.

02:36.460 --> 02:38.060
Ngh, ow!

02:38.200 --> 02:42.240
As for weak people who think they're strong…

02:42.360 --> 02:43.780
Let go of me!

02:45.140 --> 02:46.060
Huh?

02:46.340 --> 02:49.140
It's too early in the day to be that lame.

02:49.540 --> 02:51.680
Huh? What's your damage?

02:51.880 --> 02:53.760
Think you're better'n me?

02:53.960 --> 02:55.370
Butt out!

02:59.760 --> 03:00.920
They make me sick.

03:06.540 --> 03:11.920
What's wrong with your head to make you think
you're strong when you're so not?

03:14.060 --> 03:17.120
Drill my face and name into your skulls.

03:17.800 --> 03:20.400
Tell the weak to run.

03:20.660 --> 03:23.580
Tell the strong how to find me.

03:24.160 --> 03:25.760
I am…

03:27.080 --> 03:30.720
Sakura Haruka, from Furin High!

05:11.680 --> 05:12.960
Wait!

05:13.820 --> 05:16.280
Hey! Wait, I said!

05:17.560 --> 05:18.620
Thank you.

05:20.080 --> 05:21.100
Huh?

05:25.500 --> 05:26.940
Wait, me?

05:27.520 --> 05:29.920
Do you see anyone else?

05:34.020 --> 05:36.960
I didn't do that to save you!

05:37.080 --> 05:39.560
Those guys pissed me off, is all!

05:40.300 --> 05:43.260
About that… You hungry?

05:43.400 --> 05:45.560
Huh?! No, I'm not!

05:47.440 --> 05:51.480
Wow. So you're not from around here, Sakura?

05:52.180 --> 05:54.340
No wonder I've never seen you around.

05:54.660 --> 05:57.560
It's pretty rare for anyone to come to this town.

05:57.940 --> 06:00.000
You think I'm some weirdo.

06:00.120 --> 06:04.000
No, no. I wasn't saying there was
anything wrong with you.

06:04.300 --> 06:08.960
It's just that, until recently, this team
or that gang was always going at it,

06:08.960 --> 06:10.960
and public safety was near zero.

06:11.040 --> 06:13.440
Normal people all steered clear.

06:13.880 --> 06:17.560
But I'm one to talk.
I'm not originally from here, either.

06:18.520 --> 06:21.780
Name's Tachibana Kotoha. Nice to meet you.

06:22.220 --> 06:26.300
This woman… Why's she acting so friendly?

06:26.460 --> 06:31.380
Most people would be afraid.
I mean, I beat up five guys in front of her!

06:31.700 --> 06:32.980
Not to mention…

06:33.120 --> 06:34.980
What, not going to eat?

06:35.240 --> 06:37.000
Do you not like rice omelettes?

06:37.180 --> 06:39.780
I'm eating! Look, I'm eating it now!

06:42.040 --> 06:43.440
Whoa!

06:46.920 --> 06:49.020
Does this store do take-off?

06:49.190 --> 06:52.170
Huh? You mean take-out? No.

06:52.310 --> 06:54.920
O-Oh… You don't…

06:55.400 --> 06:58.220
That aside, you sure look unique.

06:58.380 --> 07:03.100
One side's all different colors.
You don't dye it or use a contact, do you?

07:03.420 --> 07:05.660
Huh? You got a problem with…

07:05.660 --> 07:07.780
Wow, it's like a marble.

07:07.920 --> 07:09.500
Eyes come in this color?

07:11.520 --> 07:13.160
What, you wanna go?!

07:13.260 --> 07:15.280
Don't snap on me.

07:15.580 --> 07:21.300
You're weird. Most people
get grossed out or tell me to change it.

07:21.600 --> 07:24.720
I'm used to seeing worse.

07:24.960 --> 07:25.740
Like this.

07:25.740 --> 07:26.860
Like what?

07:27.940 --> 07:29.200
Wait, is that why…?

07:32.440 --> 07:34.400
Looks don't matter in a fight.

07:35.780 --> 07:37.860
That's why I came to Furin.

07:38.270 --> 07:40.740
[Furin]

07:40.740 --> 07:45.880
The worst grades, but the best fighters.
Slip through the cracks, end up here.

07:46.380 --> 07:49.180
Factions brawl every day to decide who's on top.

07:49.640 --> 07:53.180
They say there's fights
every day, even on holidays.

07:54.100 --> 07:56.440
And I'm gonna be top dog there.

07:56.860 --> 07:58.780
Somebody's aiming big.

07:58.960 --> 08:03.500
As if. I'm dumb as a brick. Fighting's all I know.

08:03.820 --> 08:06.900
What could be better than
fighting to be number one?

08:07.500 --> 08:10.740
It's a fight to decide
who's the worst of the worst.

08:11.520 --> 08:13.100
That's perfect for me.

08:14.760 --> 08:17.180
You really have high hopes, huh?

08:19.840 --> 08:24.900
Oh! That's why you're in your uniform when school
doesn't start until tomorrow! You're excited!

08:25.760 --> 08:28.460
Wh…?! No! This is just…

08:28.640 --> 08:30.780
I just moved, I have nothing to wear!

08:30.780 --> 08:34.920
I get it, I get it.
You're looking forward to school.

08:35.020 --> 08:36.980
You wanna take this outside?!

08:36.980 --> 08:39.400
Tasty as always, Kotoha.

08:40.560 --> 08:42.840
Money's on the table.

08:42.980 --> 08:46.580
Thanks! Good seeing you, Yama!

08:47.060 --> 08:48.200
Careful heading home.

08:48.380 --> 08:50.260
Yes, ma'am. See you again.

08:50.920 --> 08:52.060
Hey, old man.

08:53.680 --> 08:55.240
You forgot your bag.

08:57.980 --> 08:59.780
What a blunder!

09:00.240 --> 09:03.460
Goodness me, I've been
forgetting things left and right.

09:13.060 --> 09:14.680
I don't get it.

09:15.760 --> 09:17.140
These are for you.

09:17.420 --> 09:20.840
He told me that was a present for his grandkid.

09:21.340 --> 09:23.960
And to say thanks for noticing.

09:25.140 --> 09:26.820
Why are you blushing?

09:26.900 --> 09:29.500
Huh?! Sh-Shut up!

09:29.820 --> 09:33.420
This whole town's messed up! You included!

09:33.520 --> 09:34.060
Huh?

09:34.280 --> 09:35.940
I look like this…

09:36.240 --> 09:40.460
And I'm wearing a uniform from
a school of delinquents!

09:40.900 --> 09:44.400
Why would anyone say th… Why would they thank me?!

09:44.600 --> 09:47.400
Most people would be on their guard! Distrustful!

09:47.680 --> 09:51.720
I picked someone's wallet up for them,
and they accused me of stealing it!

09:51.940 --> 09:55.400
[Officer!]
You gotta at least look inside! Be more careful!

09:55.780 --> 09:59.500
Do you want people to trust you or not?

10:01.600 --> 10:05.420
Sakura, you made a good call choosing Furin.

10:06.700 --> 10:10.880
But you won't be top dog there.

10:11.880 --> 10:13.320
You can't.

10:13.660 --> 10:14.600
What?

10:15.180 --> 10:20.480
As you are now, you might not beat
anyone there, let alone be top dog.

10:20.480 --> 10:21.540
Cut the crap!

10:21.920 --> 10:24.340
You don't know how strong I am!

10:25.120 --> 10:27.700
Sure, you might have strong muscles.

10:28.200 --> 10:31.000
But you still can't be top dog at Furin.

10:32.160 --> 10:33.480
Because you're…

10:35.600 --> 10:37.060
alone.

10:43.720 --> 10:47.200
I'm not so weak that I have to
rely on anybody else to win!

10:51.480 --> 10:53.720
I'm not talking physical strength.

10:54.200 --> 10:57.560
You should go meet some Furin kids.

10:58.620 --> 11:02.140
Then you'll understand.

11:21.860 --> 11:23.280
Ah, hello?!

11:25.180 --> 11:27.240
Well, well.

11:28.420 --> 11:32.100
Didn't expect you to come to us.

11:33.240 --> 11:35.260
Furin bitch.

11:54.240 --> 11:56.460
Hey, now, ignoring me?

11:56.780 --> 12:02.560
You told me not to forget your face or name,
but did you forget mine?

12:02.780 --> 12:05.780
Not like anyone could forget your stupid mug.

12:06.340 --> 12:09.600
Contact, wig, what kinda cosplay is this?

12:09.780 --> 12:11.560
Huh? Wait…

12:11.880 --> 12:15.480
This is your real hair? And that's not a contact!

12:15.640 --> 12:17.560
Wait, that's seriously real?

12:17.560 --> 12:18.760
What is he, a cat?

12:19.000 --> 12:20.660
Meow, meow!

12:21.160 --> 12:22.860
Disgusting.

12:24.960 --> 12:26.740
This is more like it.

12:26.940 --> 12:29.040
This is a normal reaction.

12:29.420 --> 12:32.420
The disgust and derision they show me.

12:32.640 --> 12:34.860
And that's fine. I've given up.

12:35.300 --> 12:39.180
But I at least want to believe I have value.

12:39.580 --> 12:45.080
If I can beat whoever's in front of me,
I can feel like I'm better than them, but…

12:45.640 --> 12:48.240
You can't be top dog at Furin.

12:48.820 --> 12:51.260
Because you're alone.

12:54.160 --> 12:56.700
You picked the wrong guy to punch.

12:56.900 --> 13:00.040
Ain't no gang who'll ignore
a guy punching their boss.

13:00.580 --> 13:04.030
Now it's war. Us against Furin in…

13:05.600 --> 13:08.040
I'm not the one avoiding people!

13:08.780 --> 13:10.180
It makes no sense.

13:10.260 --> 13:13.440
I know better than anyone I look weird!

13:13.840 --> 13:16.880
But I never did anything to you!

13:18.580 --> 13:19.740
This is…

13:20.140 --> 13:21.960
This is who I am!

13:22.240 --> 13:23.660
Now you've done it!

13:23.660 --> 13:25.380
As long as I'm a good fighter,

13:25.580 --> 13:28.140
if I'm the strongest, I'm top dog!

13:28.280 --> 13:30.700
What does being alone have to do with it?!

13:33.620 --> 13:34.360
You…!

14:04.200 --> 14:04.900
Bastard!

14:17.940 --> 14:19.240
What are you doing?!

14:19.340 --> 14:21.680
Hands at your sides, bitch!

14:21.800 --> 14:26.820
You Furin shits can't do a thing
if we take the locals hostage!

14:31.860 --> 14:32.920
Thank you!

14:32.920 --> 14:36.660
Don't get it twisted. Those guys
pissed me off, is all.

14:37.320 --> 14:39.440
Bringing a knife…

14:39.940 --> 14:42.580
Let's keep this fight clean, pricks.

14:49.280 --> 14:51.620
I know your type.

15:03.760 --> 15:05.060
Dammit!

15:05.500 --> 15:07.860
I can't get anywhere on defense!

15:08.480 --> 15:11.060
Why am I even defending her?!

15:11.600 --> 15:15.940
Doing things for other people never ends well!

15:26.120 --> 15:27.060
Ow!

15:29.920 --> 15:31.400
See?

15:32.240 --> 15:34.420
That's why you don't defend people.

15:35.420 --> 15:36.760
Sakura…!

15:38.160 --> 15:41.520
Seriously, what am I even doing?

15:42.580 --> 15:44.180
What am I trying to do?

15:46.260 --> 15:48.940
You a first-year? Glad you were here.

15:50.600 --> 15:53.400
That's a Furin uniform…

15:57.240 --> 15:58.380
Kotoha.

16:00.020 --> 16:04.400
Don't tell you-know-who you were in danger, okay?

16:11.880 --> 16:13.320
Hey, punks.

16:20.020 --> 16:24.220
You made a real mess of this town.

16:26.940 --> 16:30.100
You know what that means?! Huh?!

16:30.760 --> 16:34.640
This all? I heard there'd be way more of 'em!

16:34.640 --> 16:37.020
We coulda won this with just two of us.

16:37.700 --> 16:39.040
Why?

16:39.680 --> 16:42.200
Why is Furin saving me?

16:42.480 --> 16:43.560
It's Furin!

16:43.560 --> 16:44.940
Not just Furin, Hiiragi!

16:44.940 --> 16:48.180
Don't wimp out! There's only four more!

16:48.340 --> 16:49.740
Get 'em!

16:51.060 --> 16:51.910
Matsumoto!

16:51.910 --> 16:52.910
Kaji!

16:52.910 --> 16:54.160
Yanagida!

16:54.200 --> 16:57.020
Don't let them get one step farther!

16:57.020 --> 16:58.420
Kick their asses!

16:59.360 --> 17:00.660
Take this!

17:00.660 --> 17:02.180
Down you go!

17:10.980 --> 17:12.500
Have some of this!

17:15.940 --> 17:16.960
You're dead!

17:17.140 --> 17:18.220
Oh, crap!

17:20.480 --> 17:22.480
If you're hurt, stand back!

17:23.900 --> 17:26.420
You're not the boss of me! They were mine!

17:26.520 --> 17:29.600
Hold still, dumbass! Don't move around, or…

17:30.300 --> 17:32.080
we can't protect you!

17:45.280 --> 17:47.420
- You got this!
- We were waiting!

17:49.320 --> 17:52.380
What? What's going on?

17:53.340 --> 17:58.520
You know how I said that until recently,
teams and gangs were always going at it,

17:58.640 --> 18:01.560
and public safety was near zero?

18:01.960 --> 18:06.320
That was specifically until two years ago.
Then the town changed.

18:06.940 --> 18:10.440
And it was the students of Furin who changed it.

18:11.080 --> 18:14.980
First, they put a notice board
at the town's entrance.

18:16.480 --> 18:20.480
Learn to read, even if you
don't know how to use a bat!

18:21.400 --> 18:24.620
If you bring trouble,

18:24.940 --> 18:28.700
or harm people or property beyond here…

18:28.940 --> 18:33.500
It was originally written as "Furin High",

18:33.860 --> 18:38.180
but at some point the people here
gave them a new name.

18:38.760 --> 18:42.200
Because they fight to protect the town.

18:42.800 --> 18:47.700
Bofurin will purge you, no matter who you are!

18:48.320 --> 18:51.640
This town's shield, Bofurin.

18:52.620 --> 18:54.780
Wind Breaker.

18:58.340 --> 18:59.980
Thank you all so much…

18:59.980 --> 19:02.420
You're lifesavers.

19:04.040 --> 19:06.480
Furin was a bunch of low-grade hoodlums…

19:06.860 --> 19:09.300
Until two years ago.

19:09.860 --> 19:12.780
Though they do still fight a lot.

19:13.500 --> 19:16.820
- Granny, that was nowhere near a hundred!
- Now they're beloved by all.

19:17.120 --> 19:19.680
- And they're needed.
- My eyes must be going!

19:20.740 --> 19:22.280
What gives?

19:23.120 --> 19:26.740
This is like they're… heroes.

19:29.420 --> 19:32.640
- It was so cool when you bent the bat!
- They fight looking like that,

19:33.300 --> 19:37.780
but nobody's afraid of them? They're accepted?

19:38.360 --> 19:39.600
What?!

19:41.760 --> 19:44.120
You did great, too, bud!

19:44.240 --> 19:46.800
Way to hold out by yourself!

19:46.980 --> 19:50.120
Kiddo, your ankle's hurt, isn't it?

19:50.220 --> 19:52.420
We have to treat that.

19:56.780 --> 19:58.120
Stop!

20:06.260 --> 20:08.020
Sakura.

20:08.940 --> 20:11.740
I said you were alone.

20:12.200 --> 20:17.000
But I can tell at a glance
that you didn't choose to be.

20:17.400 --> 20:18.480
I think.

20:19.820 --> 20:24.280
Still, the people of this town need you.

20:24.680 --> 20:29.580
Don't spout crap! I don't need anyone!
I don't get involved!

20:29.580 --> 20:30.840
Then why?

20:31.340 --> 20:34.100
Why'd you bring Yama his bag?

20:35.020 --> 20:38.020
Why did you save me?

20:39.420 --> 20:41.820
You haven't given up on people.

20:42.140 --> 20:43.960
And you don't have to.

20:44.620 --> 20:48.400
If nothing else, I'm not turning away from you.

20:49.140 --> 20:52.300
So how about you turn towards me?

20:53.640 --> 20:55.640
Do that, and I'm sure…

21:00.200 --> 21:02.920
You'll be able to become what you wanted.

21:14.920 --> 21:17.360
So delinquents are playing hero now?!

21:17.560 --> 21:20.740
Even I can win a fight!

21:20.980 --> 21:24.800
What's this Bofurin crap?! This shield nonsense?!

21:25.180 --> 21:28.920
It's way too damn cool!

21:36.280 --> 21:39.580
Will people stay with me here?

21:47.800 --> 21:52.920
This is a story about how a low-grade pariah
who only knows how to fight

21:53.640 --> 21:56.380
became the town's hero.

21:57.000 --> 22:00.010
[#01: Sakura Joins Furin]

23:30.360 --> 23:35.000
I came to this town, to Furin High, to fight.

23:35.400 --> 23:40.540
But it turns out the school is called
Bofurin now, and it defends the town.

23:41.280 --> 23:48.600
If you bring trouble or harm
people or property beyond here,

23:48.920 --> 23:53.140
Bofurin will purge you, no matter who you are?

23:54.380 --> 23:58.380
Sounds like Furin High will be kinda fun!
